  {
   "index": 26,
   "tag": "p",
   "landmarks": [
    "main",
    "article"
   ],
   "textLength": 124,
   "text": "Some UX outcomes never translate cleanly into revenue, and pretending they do weakens the parts of your case that are solid.",
