   }
  },
  {
   "index": 37,
   "tag": "p",
   "landmarks": [
    "main",
    "article"
   ],
   "textLength": 496,
   "text": "When someone challenges the numbers, don’t flinch. Show the controlled experiment, the cohort analysis, and the before-and-after metrics, every figure holding steady from the first slide to the last, the way Meridian’s did, with the customer quotes and the employee-satisfaction data sitting right beside the revenue impact. Prove the work does more than delight users, and be ready to defend the rat",
